+MT8192 with MT6359, RT1015 and RT5682 CODECS
+
+Required properties:
+- compatible:		"mediatek,mt8192_mt6359_rt1015_rt5682"
+- mediatek,platform:	The phandle of MT8192 ASoC platform
+- pinctrl-names:	The list of names to assign states. List entry 0
+			defines the name for integer state ID 0, list entry 1
+			for state ID 1, and so on.
+- pinctrl-n:		List of phandles, each pointing at a pin configuration
+			node within a pin controller.
+
+
+Example:
+
+	sound: mt8192-sound {
+		compatible = "mediatek,mt8183_mt6358_ts3a227_max98357";
+		mediatek,platform = <&afe>;
+		pinctrl-names = "aud_clk_mosi_off";
+		pinctrl-0 = "&aud_clk_mosi_off";
+	};
+
